<td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"44\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"521\" colspan=\"3\">\n                        <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">1. 확정 : 휴학신청 및 서류제출 후 다음날 오후 1시 이후(주말제외)</font></span></p>\n                        <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">2. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">확인</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> : 원스톱서비스 로그인→학적→학적 및 각종자료조회→</font></span></p>\n                        <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-LEFT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학적변동내역</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;</font></span>\n            <p></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;※ 유의사항</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 일반휴학 허가는 수업일수 1/4선(2009년 3월 27일)까지만 허용. </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. </font></span><strong><u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">개강이후 휴학 신청은 등록금 납부기간에 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">등록금을 완납한 학생에</font></span></u></strong></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>한하</u></font></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><strong><u>여 허가함.</u></strong> </font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 휴학생도 2월 17일부터 20일까지 등록금 납부 가능(납부기간경과 후</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 납부할 수 없으며 장학금혜택도 받을 수 없음).</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4. 휴학생은 수강신청 불가.</font></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">2. 복학 신청(인터넷 신청) </font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 수강신청 및 등록금 납부만으로는 복학처리가 되지 않습니다.&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; COLOR: red; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>▶&nbsp;수강신청은 복학이 확정된 학생만 가능합니다.</u></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">\n            </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff0000\">▶ 원스톱서비스-학적에 사진이 없는 학생은 3월 3일까지 학생회관 1층</font></font></font></span></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp; 학사서비스센터로 사진을 반드시 제출하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#ff0000\" face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (미제출자는 원스톱서비스 사용 및 학사업무 불가)</font></span></span></p>\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n            <table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"60\">\n                        <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;구분</font></span></p>\n                        </td>\n                        <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffc